        "created_at": "2013-01-14T14:09:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hmm, I might just look into that :). Possibly this time of year isn't the best with regard to travelling about by train, since there's no way of knowing whether it might suddenly start snowing and cause people to get stuck (and in my case, it can snow all the way over in Dover or Ramsgate or thereabouts and bugger up my train line ;)), but we can maybe at least set something up for the future :). I can also talk about it with my partner and see if he has any preference.</p>",
