        "created_at": "2013-01-22T22:02:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just to let you know, I did join the LoB board thingy not long after this previous post, and I sent you a message on there PWatson. At least, I think I did - the button said \"E-mail\" I think rather than PM but it was the nearest I could find so I tried it. Not that I said much - was just letting you know I'd joined on there. I need to actually check and see when their next Sunday is and whether there's any chance I might be able to get to it.</p>",
