        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-23T08:50:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I did get the e-mail but didn't have anything even that useful to say in reply so stayed quiet. sorry.</p><p>There's a Sunday meet-up every week up to the beginning of March. I figure the simplest way as I don't usually make the Sundays is for you to pick one that's convenient and we meet up then. Had a good game with Dan (Mezike) last night even though Iron Legacy did absolutely slaughter us. Starting with [Redacted], [Redacted] and both [Redacted]s is a really brutal combo with 5 heroes. Everyone bar Absolrute Zero was dead within 3 turns.</p><p>EDIT: Redacted tthe card names just in case. Also because it's funnier.</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
