        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-23T09:34:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As I don't have access to anything that's not yet released, I don't know what Vigilance does and I didn't know it was possible to get out two Inspiring Presences or even that Iron Leggy had those cards in his deck. But ouch, from the sounds of it, lol.</p><p>I'll get back to you on what is the best Sunday - I'll check with my partner. I also need to double check where in London it is because I can't remember. Then I can see how easily I can get there on the Tube from Victoria :).</p>",
