        "created_at": "2013-01-23T21:10:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh that's cool, I just looked on a Tube map and St. James's Park is the next one along from Victoria, so we probably won't even need to get the Tube :D. I'm on Skype with Ja'Ph' now and he's up for it. We're at my place this weekend but we can be at his next weekend (closer to London so the train fare will be cheaper :D). So would that Sunday be okay?</p>",
